+    # Pre-compile the page templates at startup (boot) so the FIRST visit to a
+    # page never pays Jinja's one-time compile cost (~0.5 s per template on the
+    # C906). Best-effort — a template that isn't found just isn't pre-warmed.
+    for _t in ("base.html", "login.html", "dashboard.html", "network.html",
+               "reticulum.html", "settings.html", "wifi.html", "donate.html"):
